        {
            "id": "https://costalong.com/2026/06/06/claude-minsearch-mcp-protobuf-rag/",
            "url": "https://costalong.com/2026/06/06/claude-minsearch-mcp-protobuf-rag/",
            "title": "Claude 想看最新 protobuf 文档？用 minsearch + MCP 搭一个 100 行的迷你 RAG",
            "date_published": "2026-06-06T04:00:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p><img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" style=\"--img-ar:1.7778\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/claude-minsearch-mcp-protobuf-rag_2f806369cea6.webp\" alt=\"Claude + minsearch + MCP 概念封面图\"></p>\n<p>上周一个朋友发我一段他们团队 Claude Code 的接入 alias：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">alias</span> claude-otel<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'\\\n  CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY=1 \\\n  OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER=otlp \\\n  OTEL_LOGS_EXPORTER=otlp \\\n  OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL=http/protobuf \\\n  OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=https://usage.example.com \\\n  claude'</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>注意中间那行：<code>OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL=http/protobuf</code>。Claude Code 的 OpenTelemetry 导出支持 <code>grpc</code>、<code>http/json</code>、<code>http/protobuf</code> 几种协议，这个团队选的是 protobuf 二进制编码——对接可观测性后端的人，迟早要和 protobuf 打交道。</p>\n<p>问题来了：你问 Claude “protobuf editions 怎么处理向后兼容”，它的答案取决于训练数据截到哪天。Editions 在 2024 年 5 月的 protobuf 27.0 才正式发布（edition 2023），2025 年 protobuf 32 起又陆续加入 edition 2024 的新特性，模型很可能没见过最新的写法。</p>\n<p>重的方案是一整套 RAG（LangChain + 向量库 + embedding API）。轻的方案，是把 <a href=\"https://github.com/alexeygrigorev/minsearch\"><code>minsearch</code></a> 包成一个 MCP server。下面是约 100 行能跑起来的版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是-minsearch-不是-LangChain\"><a href=\"#为什么是-minsearch-不是-LangChain\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"为什么是 minsearch 不是 LangChain\"></a>为什么是 minsearch 不是 LangChain</h2><p><code>minsearch</code> 是 Alexey Grigorev（DataTalksClub 创始人）写的极小搜索引擎，截至 2026-10 在 GitHub 上不到 100 颗星。星少不是问题，它的优势正在于小：核心就几个 Python 文件，依赖只有 numpy、pandas、scikit-learn 和一个分词用的 stemlite，不需要任何服务进程或外部 API。</p>\n<p>三种 Index 模式，覆盖绝大多数本地 RAG 场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> minsearch <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Index<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> AppendableIndex<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> VectorSearch\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 基础 TF-IDF 全文检索（90% 文档场景够用）</span>\ntext_index <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Index<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    text_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"title\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    keyword_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"section\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 可追加索引（边爬边索引）</span>\nappendable <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AppendableIndex<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>text_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"title\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 向量检索（你已经有 embedding 的话）</span>\nvector_index <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorSearch<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>keyword_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"section\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>对比一下常见的几种方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n<th>何时该用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>minsearch</code> Index</td>\n<td>numpy + pandas + scikit-learn</td>\n<td>文档量小、单机、关键词检索够用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FAISS / Chroma</td>\n<td>向量库 + embedding 模型</td>\n<td>需要语义检索、文档规模大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LangChain RAG</td>\n<td>框架 + 向量库 + 模型 API</td>\n<td>要做成产品，而不是个人工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下面要索引的 4 个 protobuf 页面，抓下来的纯文本合计约 240KB，正好落在 <code>minsearch</code> 的舒适区。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token comment\"># minsearch 与 mcp 都要求 Python 3.10+</span>\npip <span class=\"token function\">install</span> minsearch\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 或者 uv add minsearch</span></code></pre>\n\n<h2 id=\"把-protobuf-文档喂给-minsearch\"><a href=\"#把-protobuf-文档喂给-minsearch\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"把 protobuf 文档喂给 minsearch\"></a>把 protobuf 文档喂给 minsearch</h2><p>protobuf.dev 上四个核心 Programming Guide 页面覆盖了大部分日常问题——<code>proto3</code>、<code>encoding</code>、<code>editions</code>、<code>proto2</code>。先把它们抓下来（需要 <code>pip install httpx</code>）：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token comment\"># download_docs.py</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> httpx\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Path\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> html<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parser <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> HTMLParser\n\nDOC_URLS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/proto3/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/encoding/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/editions/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/proto2/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TextOnly</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>HTMLParser<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token builtin\">super</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>__init__<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>skip <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_starttag</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tag<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> attrs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tag <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"script\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"style\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"nav\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"header\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"footer\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>skip <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_endtag</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tag<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tag <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"script\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"style\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"nav\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"header\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"footer\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>skip <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_data</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>skip <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nPath<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"data/protobuf\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mkdir<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>parents<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> exist_ok<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> url <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> DOC_URLS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    slug <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> url<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rstrip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rsplit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    parser <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> TextOnly<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    parser<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>feed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>httpx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>url<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> timeout<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    Path<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"data/protobuf/</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">.md\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>write_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>parser<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"saved </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>跑一遍，本地就有 <code>data/protobuf/proto3.md</code> 这样的纯文本文件。下一步切片 + 索引。切片别太复杂，按空行分段够用：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token comment\"># build_index.py</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> pickle\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Path\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> minsearch <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Index\n\nDOC_BASE <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides\"</span>\ndocs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> path <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> Path<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"data/protobuf\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>glob<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"*.md\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 按段落切片，每片 ≥ 100 字才算有效</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> chunk <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">enumerate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>text<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        chunk <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> chunk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>chunk<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">continue</span>\n        docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stem<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">#</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stem<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>             <span class=\"token comment\"># proto3 / encoding / ...</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>DOC_BASE<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">/</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stem<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">/\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> chunk<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nindex <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Index<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    text_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    keyword_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nindex<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nPath<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"index.pkl\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>write_bytes<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pickle<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"indexed </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> chunks → index.pkl\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>我在 Python 3.12 + minsearch 0.2.0 上跑这一步，4 个页面切出 402 个片段，建索引不到 1 秒。试一下检索：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> pickle\n<span class=\"token operator\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> idx <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> pickle<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">open</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"index.pkl\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"rb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> hit <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> idx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"editions backward compatible\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> num_results<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>     <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>hit<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> hit<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">80</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nencoding <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>packed<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>true<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  to existing fields <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> a forward<span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> backward<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>compatible way<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span> One\nproto3 compatible <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> the other integer types<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span> If the value written was between INT_MI\nproto2 compatible <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> the other integer types<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span> If the value written was between INT_MI</code></pre>\n\n<p>具体命中哪几段取决于抓取当天的页面内容，能返回含查询词的片段，就说明 TF-IDF 索引建对了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写一个-100-行的-MCP-server\"><a href=\"#写一个-100-行的-MCP-server\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"写一个 100 行的 MCP server\"></a>写一个 100 行的 MCP server</h2><p>MCP（Model Context Protocol）是 Anthropic 发起的 LLM 工具协议，Claude Code 原生支持。官方 Python SDK 把样板代码压到了一个装饰器。注意 SDK 在 2.x 把 <code>FastMCP</code> 改名成了 <code>MCPServer</code>（截至 2026-10 最新是 2.3.0），网上大量 <code>from mcp.server.fastmcp import FastMCP</code> 的示例在 2.x 下会直接报 <code>ModuleNotFoundError</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token comment\"># server.py</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> pickle\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Path\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mcpserver <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> MCPServer  <span class=\"token comment\"># mcp 1.x 写法：from mcp.server.fastmcp import FastMCP</span>\n\nmcp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MCPServer<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"protobuf-docs\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># mcp 1.x：FastMCP(\"protobuf-docs\")</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 进程启动时加载一次索引；按脚本所在目录找文件，因为 Claude Code 启动它时的工作目录不一定是这里</span>\n_INDEX <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> pickle<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Path<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>__file__<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>with_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"index.pkl\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read_bytes<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search_protobuf_docs</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> num_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检索 protobuf 官方文档。\n\n    Args:\n        query: 自然语言查询，例如 \"editions backward compatible\"\n        num_results: 返回结果数，默认 5\n\n    Returns:\n        命中片段列表，每项含 source（页面）、url（原文链接）、content（正文）\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    hits <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> _INDEX<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> num_results<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>num_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> h<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> h<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> h<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> h <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> hits\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> __name__ <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>transport<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"stdio\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>有四个细节值得注意：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>索引在模块级加载</strong>——MCP server 是常驻进程，启动时反序列化一次就够，没必要每次 query 都重新读文件。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>索引路径用 <code>Path(__file__)</code> 定位</strong>——如果写成相对路径 <code>Path(\"index.pkl\")</code>，Claude Code 在别的项目目录里拉起这个进程时就会找不到文件，server 启动即退出。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>工具的 docstring 不是写给人看的</strong>——它会作为工具描述发给 Claude，决定它什么时候、用什么参数调用。描述越具体（查什么、返回什么），被正确调用的概率越高；一句含糊的”搜索文档”很容易被忽略。</p>\n<p>第四，<strong>transport=stdio</strong>——Claude Code 把 stdio 类型的 MCP server 作为子进程启动，通过标准输入输出通信，不需要起 HTTP 服务、不需要管端口。本地个人工具先用 stdio 跑通，有多人共享的需求再考虑 HTTP。</p>\n<p>装一下 MCP 包：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">pip <span class=\"token function\">install</span> mcp          <span class=\"token comment\"># 装到的是 2.x</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 想继续用 FastMCP 的 1.x 写法：pip install \"mcp&lt;2\"</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 或者 uv add mcp</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>这份 server 我分别用 mcp 2.3.0（<code>MCPServer</code>）和 1.30.0（<code>FastMCP</code>）起过，用 SDK 自带的 stdio 客户端都能列出 <code>search_protobuf_docs</code> 并正常返回结果。</p>\n<p>本地先单独跑一下确认没报错：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">python server.py\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 它会卡在 stdio 等输入——正常。Ctrl-C 退出。</span></code></pre>\n\n<h2 id=\"接到-Claude-Code-里\"><a href=\"#接到-Claude-Code-里\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"接到 Claude Code 里\"></a>接到 Claude Code 里</h2><p>Claude Code 注册 MCP server 有两种姿势：CLI 一行命令，或者写 <code>.mcp.json</code>。先讲 CLI——快：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token comment\"># `--` 之后的部分会作为 stdio 子进程启动；python 要用装了 minsearch 和 mcp 的那个解释器</span>\nclaude mcp <span class=\"token function\">add</span> protobuf-docs -- /abs/path/to/.venv/bin/python /abs/path/to/server.py</code></pre>\n\n<p>注册完用 <code>claude mcp list</code> 检查，应该能看到 <code>protobuf-docs</code> 在列。不带 <code>--scope</code> 时默认只对当前项目、当前用户生效。</p>\n<p>如果你想把这个配置提交到 git（团队共享），改写成项目级 <code>.mcp.json</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-json\" data-language=\"json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"mcpServers\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"protobuf-docs\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"command\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/abs/path/to/.venv/bin/python\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/abs/path/to/server.py\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"env\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"PYTHONUNBUFFERED\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"1\"</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>放在项目根目录，下次在这个项目里启动 <code>claude</code> 时会读取它；项目级 server 第一次使用前，Claude Code 会让你确认是否信任。</p>\n<p>验证它真的能用——打开 Claude Code，问一句：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>editions 模式下 proto2 的 required 字段会怎样？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>理想情况下 Claude 会主动调一次 <code>search_protobuf_docs</code>，查询词类似 “editions proto2 required”，再把命中片段当 context 回答（editions 里 proto2 的 <code>required</code> 对应 <code>features.field_presence = LEGACY_REQUIRED</code>）。如果它没调，多半是工具描述不够具体——给 docstring 补一句”用于查询 protobuf 语法、editions、编码相关问题”这类说明，或者在提问时直接点名让它先查文档。</p>\n<p><img width=\"497\" height=\"279\" style=\"--img-ar:1.7814\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/claude-minsearch-mcp-protobuf-rag_81ce3a5c2323.webp\" alt=\"minsearch 仓库 README，列出 Index、AppendableIndex、VectorSearch 三种实现\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"通用化：换个文档源就能复用\"><a href=\"#通用化：换个文档源就能复用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"通用化：换个文档源就能复用\"></a>通用化：换个文档源就能复用</h2><p>这套结构最实用的地方是<strong>只有 download_docs.py 和 <code>DOC_BASE</code> 那一行跟 protobuf 绑定</strong>，其余代码都能直接复用。</p>\n<p>想换成索引 OTLP 规范文档？改 URL 列表，再把 build_index.py 里拼 <code>url</code> 的那行改成对应站点：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token comment\"># download_docs.py 的 DOC_URLS 改成：</span>\nDOC_URLS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otlp/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/semconv/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ...</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>想换成语义检索（embedding）而不是 TF-IDF？把 <code>Index</code> 换成 <code>VectorSearch</code>，加一步 embedding。代价是查询时也得先把 query 转成向量，server 里的 <code>search</code> 调用要跟着改：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token comment\"># build_index.py 的索引部分换成</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> minsearch <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> VectorSearch\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OpenAI\n\nclient <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> OpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nembeddings <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n    client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"text-embedding-3-small\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">input</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>d<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedding\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> docs\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\nindex <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorSearch<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>keyword_fields<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"source\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nindex<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>什么时候该升级到 FAISS / Chroma / Qdrant？文档量大到每次全量重建索引、或者整个索引放进内存都开始吃力，或者需要多个进程共享同一份索引的时候。<code>minsearch</code> 作者另外写了个 <a href=\"https://github.com/alexeygrigorev/sqlitesearch\"><code>sqlitesearch</code></a>，定位就是 minsearch 的持久化替代，适合介于两者之间的规模。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1289\" style=\"--img-ar:1.2413\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/claude-minsearch-mcp-protobuf-rag_50e12ab766ba.webp\" alt=\"Claude Code 通过 MCP stdio 调用 server.py，再查 minsearch 索引和 protobuf 文档的流程示意\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>约 100 行 Python 让 Claude 查到最新文档，比微调模型便宜得多，也比每次在 prompt 里塞几百 KB 文档省 token。</p>\n<p>下次 Claude 答非所问的时候，先想想是不是它训练数据里压根没有那个新版本特性，再决定要不要给它配一个本地索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"来源\"><a href=\"#来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"来源\"></a>来源</h2><ul>\n<li>minsearch 仓库与 API：<a href=\"https://github.com/alexeygrigorev/minsearch\">https://github.com/alexeygrigorev/minsearch</a></li>\n<li>MCP Python SDK：<a href=\"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk\">https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk</a>（2.x 的 <code>FastMCP</code> → <code>MCPServer</code> 改名见其迁移指南）</li>\n<li>Claude Code MCP 接入文档：<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp</a></li>\n<li>protobuf 官方文档：<a href=\"https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/\">https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/</a></li>\n<li>protobuf 版本发布记录：<a href=\"https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/releases\">https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/releases</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
            "tags": [
                "Coding-Agent",
                "Claude Code",
                "MCP",
                "RAG",
                "minsearch",
                "protobuf"
            ]
        }
    ]
}